@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = 请从登录结果复制
@hrKey = 请从本地配置读取
@oaKey = 请从本地配置读取
@appKey = 请从本地配置读取iam.integration.apps.OA.key
@userId = 1
@roleId = 1
@deptId = 1

### 登录：密码自行填写，不在仓库保存真实密码
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"loginType":"USERNAME","identifier":"superadmin","password":"请填写初始化密码"}

### 当前用户及 IAM 权限
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 范围内用户
GET {{base}}/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 完整替换角色集合，空数组代表回收全部
PUT {{base}}/users/{{userId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"roleIds":["{{roleId}}"]}

### HR 调岗：实际部门变化时清空角色
POST {{base}}/integrations/hr/users/{{userId}}/transfer
X-Service-Key: {{hrKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"deptId":"{{deptId}}"}

### HR 离职
POST {{base}}/integrations/hr/users/{{userId}}/terminate
X-Service-Key: {{hrKey}}

### OA 审批后执行授权
POST {{base}}/integrations/oa/roles
X-Service-Key: {{oaKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"{{userId}}","roleId":"{{roleId}}","operation":"GRANT"}

### 外部业务后端携带用户 JWT 及应用密钥鉴权
POST {{base}}/auth/check
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-App-Code: OA
X-Service-Key: {{appKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"method":"GET","route":"/api/v1/demo/OA/feature1"}

### 可执行的 OA 业务演示
GET {{base}}/demo/OA/feature1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
